OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather wet day as showery
OL,6,Frain, sometimes heavy with thunder and
OL,7,Fhail, moves southwards across the
OL,8,Fregion. Often cloudy as a result of
OL,9,Fthis but a few brighter breaks are
OL,10,Fpossible, mainly later. Feeling cool
OL,11,Fin the northerly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers fading inland during
OL,14,Fthe evening, then becoming largely dry
OL,15,Fovernight with clear spells. Staying
OL,16,Fbreezy along the coast with isolated
OL,17,Fshowers continuing. A notably cooler
OL,18,Fnight than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,167,160,301,260,100,100
