OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOutbreaks of rain spreading
OL,6,Fsouthwards to begin. These clearing to
OL,7,Fleave a drier afternoon with brighter
OL,8,Fbreaks emerging later. Temperatures
OL,9,Fbelow the seasonal average and the
OL,10,Fcool breeze continues.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FBecoming more settled with an
OL,14,Fincreasing number of sunny spells.
OL,15,FSmall chance of a shower on Saturday.
OL,16,FTemperatures below average for August
OL,17,Fbut feeling pleasant where the
OL,18,Fsunshine emerges.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
